{"server":"tw","storyId":"act5d0_level_act5d0_09_beg","groupId":"act5d0","stageId":"act5d0_09","title":"0:01A.M.","storyCode":"CB-9","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_09_beg.txt","sourceHash":"53f9e35486b09a5ac0edee5a5a5542ec830491f47406b6cf6fcd0825093439fe","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"鼠王出現並救下了槐琥與孑。卡彭也刺傷了甘比諾，並希望以此投誠，卻遭到鼠王拒絕。黑手黨早已被鼠王吞噬，這一切盡在他的掌握。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二关（前）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_2"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"......該結束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"你很強，讓我見識到了一些有趣的功夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"但是我不能陪你繼續耗下去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"很抱歉，你，你的同伴，還有那個叛徒，都要死在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"所有人，抬起武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"準備！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"想利用人數優勢嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"沒那麼簡單，甘比諾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"聽著，“首領”開火的一瞬間，就宣告了正式的決裂，你們從此和甘比諾家族沒有任何關係，不要手下留情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫B","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"明白！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"槐琥，這邊也......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"我們被夾在中間了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，家族四分五裂，原本的獵物全都變成了獵手，踩著互相設下的陷阱混戰一場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"這情況真是和敘拉古那次如出一轍......但這一次，我們必須贏下賭局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜你的賭運向來不順。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，夠了，停手吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"——你竟然會離開那個骯髒的地方來到這裡？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"甘比諾先生，很遺憾，我給了你和你的家族很多次機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"我們根本沒有信任可言，你真以為我會把家族交給一個西西里人之外的怪物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"西西里人。儘管我這輩子都未曾踏足過敘拉古的城邦，但我也知道，你們早已經不配如此稱呼自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"......你到底準備做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"提問的機會已經用完了，年輕人，在龍門可沒有那麼多犯規機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"有些是你，有些是那邊那位，無論如何，你們越界過多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"你想反悔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"我從未承諾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。你真覺得能對付得了我們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"你只是坐在下水道裡的王座上，對著那些不得不為你賣命的人指指點點，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"作為一家之長，你應當學會開闊一些視野。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"比起我們所經歷的一切，你在敘拉古的挫折不過是九牛一毛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"閉嘴！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"......那麼，你可曾見過真正的鋼鐵洪流兵臨城下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"移動著的城市互相傾軋，硝煙浸染天空，瀕死的感染者腐爛在垃圾堆旁，嘶聲力竭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"你一無所知，卻妄想要對抗一座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"（他的力量......超出常理，他和那個女人身邊的......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"（該死，至少現在不能繼續刺激鼠王......還沒到時候......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"......你自以為能代表整個龍門？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"龍門並不能代表我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"廢話少說！喝啊——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有人允許，你對這位老人出手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"......躲開點，槐琥！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖！礙事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝，你就是阿孑，我聽過你的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"你就是阿伯掛在嘴上的那個......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，老朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你們幫龍門阻止了他們，也謝謝你們伸張正義的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，請離開這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"可是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"我答應過很多人，至少不要讓孩子們捲進這種事情裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"......槐琥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"——好吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子們已經離開，所以你們已經毫無勝算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"放下武器，跪下，至少你們的“家人”有活下去的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"這種威脅，你覺得有用嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"......你踏在我們的土地上，一如敘拉古於你。你會認識到這一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"擺在賭桌上的籌碼正搖搖欲墜，年輕人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"流、流沙！？快躲開！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫B","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"呃啊啊！我、我的手！不要碰到那些沙子！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"你膽敢——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"冷靜點年輕人，你的劍都不需要我騰出手來對付。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"環顧一下你周圍的同伴，這座城市流的血已經很多了，我不想看見“家人”自相殘殺的戲碼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"這是最後一次機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"我絕不會再當第二次懦夫——離開敘拉古，已經是為了家族的存續做出的最後妥協。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"這一次，我寧可像一個真正的西西里人那樣死在這裡，也絕不會讓敵人看到我夾著尾巴逃跑的背影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"也許在你心中，戰士理應如此，但作為一名領袖，過猶不及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"你應該多回過頭，看看人心叵測，可惜，遲了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"呃啊——！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"——該結束了，甘比諾，你不應該帶著家族以卵擊石。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"卡彭，你，你竟敢！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"安靜點，也許這樣你還能死個痛快。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"咕！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"......哼，你倒是一點都不吃驚，還是說，你在等著我走到這一步？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"你想要什麼，刺殺領袖的陰謀家？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"我會將整個家族雙手奉上，我們要在龍門活下去，而不是陪著什麼榮譽毫無意義地去死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"......可惜，如果你們真的願意齊心協力，也不至於被那個女人驅逐出敘拉古。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道的很多......但我不會問，龍門有龍門的規矩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"——是啊，龍門有龍門的規矩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"對於願意親手解決了忤逆者的你，我應該網開一面。你想這麼說，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"我的家族將會聽命於你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"......“你的家族”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"這只是形勢所迫罷了，你錯估了很多事情，所以你不得不出此下策。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"的確，今晚有很多出乎我預料的事情，我不得不一再退讓，可這就是生意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，生意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"你說得對，這是一筆不錯的買賣，合情合理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"但那是龍門的規矩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"不是我的規矩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"我並不需要你的忠誠，自始至終。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"你們......原來如此，從一開始，你們就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們只是選擇了更簡單的存活方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"企圖滲透進龍門的勢力有很多，而互相猜忌讓你們變成了一盤散沙。敲碎岩石固然困難，但掬起一捧沙，輕而易舉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"但爾虞我詐並不有趣，至少我這麼覺得。最重要的是，我剛才說過，我不想看見家人自相殘殺的戲碼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"然後你就親手打傷了你的兄弟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"在這件事上，你沒有越過紅線，所以我不會殺你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"只是你忤逆了我，我並不需要多出一個詭計多端的好朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"你——！從一開始就已經把這些人安排在我們身邊，你在等著我們分裂的時機，你到底——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"多話短命，年輕人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......在你玩弄權柄的時候，你的部下們卻在為你們考慮，真是感人至深。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"他們的效忠會為他們贏得在龍門生存的機會，以及，為你們兩人各買了一條性命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，你們已經親眼目睹了你們的兩位領袖做出的選擇，現在，輪到你們履行承諾了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"——鼠王，不，林，灰色的林，你比我們更像一個西西里人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"你踐踏了我的尊嚴，卻還要饒我一命，你是在羞辱我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"真奇怪。你為了活命，甚至不惜對兄弟和領袖拔劍相向，而我饒你一命，你現在又一心求死？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"我本以為只有那邊那個昏死過去的領袖，才會這樣咬牙切齒地看著我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"因為，我也是，“西西里人”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"還是說，怎麼，你真的以為熄滅了敘拉古的“家族”之一，還能安然無事地置身事外？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"無用的威脅。你應該明白，沒有人還會為一支被除名的家族大動干戈，退一萬步說，就算還有一些不識趣的散兵游勇——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"——那就讓他們來吧。讓他們在這座城市真正的怒火下分崩離析。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"——唔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"僅憑你自己根本沒有力量與我們抗衡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，滾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"......我也沒不識趣到會三番兩次地挑釁找死，但你一定會後悔今天沒有殺我，沒有殺一個西西里人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"一定。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果，我現在立刻派人殺了他，你們會怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"您不會這麼做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"但也許他說得對，我沒必要對一個敘拉古黑手黨如此寬容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"我們與您做了交易。如果走到兵刃相向的那一步，我們會投誠，而您放過其他人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"——除非那些剩下的黑手黨執意要你死我活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，放心，他沒有那個意思。他只是個想活下去的懦夫。但他的怒火也不似作假。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"人無儀，不死何為。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"真有趣，他那微不足道的尊嚴反倒救了他一命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"......謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，該為今晚的事情收場了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","aliases":["槐琥"]},{"speakerId":"char_272_strong","aliases":["孑"]}]}
